          "$id": "fx0",
          "active": true,
          "code": "// @whimtex-effect Samples/Glaze Crazing\r\n// @control(_Opacity)\r\n// @param hidden float _Opacity = 0.18 [0 .. 1]\r\n// @param float _Width = 0.004 [0.001 .. 0.03]\r\n\r\nfloat4 ApplyFX(float2 uv,float4 color){\r\n float d=abs(color.r-.5);float coverage=1-smoothstep(_Width,_Width+fwidth(color.r),d);\r\n return float4(.06,.11,.105,coverage*_Opacity);}\r\n",
